msgstr ""

msgid "Plans for future enhancements"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"There are a few other dependency resolution related performance improvements "
"relevant for mainly for `quarkus:dev` and `test` Maven goals that are coming "
"in 3.12. In 3.12 the incubating application model resolver will be enabled "
"by default in dev mode. Once enough feedback has been collected on its "
"operation, the incubating implementation will replace the current "
"application model resolver implementation."
msgstr ""
